{
  "id": "unique-event-030",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#30 - one of us\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1263,1279]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You follow the kid into the alley.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1279,1314]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "He is being harassed by a group\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1314,1346]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of mean looking teens wearing\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1346,1376]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creepy Halloween masks. They\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1376,1405]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "circle him and shove him off\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1405,1434]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "balance. As you intervene to stop\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1434,1468]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the bullies, they turn to you,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1468,1499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hissing “He was one of us and he\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1499,1532]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "went away. Now he has to pay!”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1532,1563]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may leave the kid to this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1563,1593]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "company of delinquent youths (go\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1593,1626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "back to your exploration of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1626,1658]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "town) or ask that they leave him\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1658,1691]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-030:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "alone (go to #32).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1691,1710]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    90
  ]
}
